      "message": "This fails with: Unable to freeze job graph: Job \u003cJob job-transitive-protected explicit: None implied: {MatchAny:{ImpliedBranchMatcher:master}} source: common-config/zuul.yaml@master#14\u003e which is defined in review.example.com/org/project is protected and cannot be inherited from other projects.\n\nI think that\u0027s expected because we say: \"only jobs defined in the same project may inherit from this job\" and job-use-transitive inherits from a job in another repo that is protected (because it inherits from a protected job).",
